      "solution": "Đặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (cm) với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tSuy ra chiều dài nếp gấp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tXét <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> trên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDo đó chiều dài nếp gấp nhỏ nhất là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>min</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> cm khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm.",
